  "description": "Cocoa Morado is a dark and luxurious gourmand fragrance that blends rich chocolate accords with warm spices, creamy sweetness, and smooth woody depth. The scent feels indulgent, sophisticated, and addictive with a bold niche-inspired character. The opening introduces cacao, coffee, and spicy accords, creating a deep roasted sweetness with warm aromatic intensity. The heart develops into creamy gourmand notes and soft woods, adding smooth richness and elegant warmth to the composition. The base settles into vanilla, amber, patchouli, and musk, leaving a warm, slightly smoky, and long-lasting trail that feels decadent and refined. Cocoa Morado is perfect for those who enjoy dark chocolate gourmand fragrances with woody warmth and rich oriental depth.",
